{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POKERICABRA is a roguelike, retro-styled puzzle-RPG that blends falling-block gameplay with poker\u2011hand strategy. Drop card-shaped pieces into the grid, form poker hands in a line to deal damage and unleash powerful effects!\u00a0Survive waves of enemies across different stages. Every hand you make matters \u2014  deal damage, trigger shields, or gain gold for deck upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027440/extras/649aee05b327c80007732f049d35ca75.poster.avif?t=1761032722\" width=634 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027440/extras/649aee05b327c80007732f049d35ca75.webm?t=1761032722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027440/extras/649aee05b327c80007732f049d35ca75.mp4?t=1761032722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between levels you\u2019ll visit the shop to buy passives and consumables, customize your deck, and choose challenge modifiers that change how the game plays. The game supports short sessions and long runs: each play is a test of tactical placements, adaptive to RNG, and preparedness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027440/extras/283776b3def54a54ad731f874146b5fe.avif?t=1761032722\" width=911 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hybrid gameplay: falling-block placement + poker-hand combination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression loop: win stages \u2192 shop for upgrades \u2192 push for higher difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck &amp; shop systems: collect unique passives, consumables, and deck upgrades to customize your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes: normal runs, Hard/Hell Mode, and endless challenge options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bosses : Bosses have unique abilities to make the game more challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, satisfying runs with deep mastery for high-skill play and score-chasing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027440?t=1761032722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027440/8f37f1e3ad0b10250646fea585567bf4c6419ccd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761032722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027440/a2eaaaf833b52b24ef4be014c4cadbe37e23471e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761032722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027440/a2eaaaf833b52b24ef4be014c4cadbe37e23471e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761032722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POKERICABRA is a roguelike, retro-styled puzzle-RPG that blends falling-block gameplay with poker\u2011hand strategy. Drop card-shaped pieces into the grid, form poker hands in a line to deal damage and unleash powerful effects!\u00a0Survive waves of enemies across different stages. Every hand you make matters \u2014  deal damage, trigger shields, or gain gold for deck upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin